sequenceDiagram
    participant Client as External Client
    participant GW as Gateway API<br/>(data-science-gateway)<br/>openshift-ingress
    participant Authorino as Kuadrant/Authorino<br/>AuthPolicy
    participant MaaSAPI as maas-api<br/>:8443 TLS
    participant K8sAPI as Kubernetes API<br/>:6443 HTTPS
    participant DB as PostgreSQL<br/>Database
    participant Controller as maas-controller<br/>Operator
    participant KServe as KServe<br/>LLMInferenceService

    Note over Client,KServe: External API Request Flow (Gateway-routed paths)

    Client->>GW: POST /v1/models, /v1/subscriptions,<br/>/v1/api-keys, /maas-api/*
    GW->>Authorino: HTTPRoute → AuthPolicy evaluation

    alt API Key Auth
        Authorino->>MaaSAPI: Callback: /internal/v1/api-keys/validate<br/>Bearer sk-oai-*
        MaaSAPI-->>Authorino: Validation result
    else Kubernetes TokenReview
        Authorino->>K8sAPI: TokenReview (cluster audience)
        K8sAPI-->>Authorino: Token identity
    else OIDC JWT (optional)
        Authorino->>Authorino: JWT validation via OIDC provider
    end

    Authorino->>Authorino: OPA authorization<br/>(subscription, group, tenant isolation)
    Authorino-->>GW: Inject headers:<br/>X-MaaS-Username, X-MaaS-Group,<br/>X-MaaS-Subscription
    GW->>MaaSAPI: Authenticated request<br/>:8443 TLS
    MaaSAPI->>DB: Query/update data
    DB-->>MaaSAPI: Result
    MaaSAPI-->>GW: JSON response
    GW-->>Client: Response

    Note over Client,KServe: Internal API Path (bypasses Gateway)

    Client->>MaaSAPI: GET /v1/tenants<br/>(direct Service call)
    MaaSAPI->>K8sAPI: TokenReview (bearer token)
    K8sAPI-->>MaaSAPI: Identity
    MaaSAPI->>K8sAPI: SubjectAccessReview<br/>(system:authenticated)
    K8sAPI-->>MaaSAPI: Authorization decision
    MaaSAPI-->>Client: Tenant data

    Note over Client,KServe: Controller Reconciliation Loop

    KServe-->>Controller: Watch LLMInferenceService<br/>(conditional, dynamic registration)
    Controller->>K8sAPI: Watch CRDs:<br/>AITenant, MaaSAuthPolicy,<br/>MaaSModelRef, MaaSSubscription,<br/>MaasTenantConfig, Tenant
    K8sAPI-->>Controller: Resource events
    Controller->>K8sAPI: Create AuthPolicy<br/>(Kuadrant)
    Controller->>K8sAPI: Create TokenRateLimitPolicy
    Controller->>K8sAPI: Create/Update HTTPRoutes

    Note over Client,KServe: Observability Egress

    MaaSAPI->>MaaSAPI: Prometheus metrics :9090
    MaaSAPI->>MaaSAPI: OTLP/gRPC traces →<br/>OpenTelemetry Collector
